  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A smooth circular groove has a smooth vertical wall as shown in figure. A block of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> moves against the wall with a speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>. Which of the following curve represents the correct relation between the normal reaction on the block by the wall <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>N</mi></mfenced></math> and speed of the block <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>v</mi></mfenced></math>?</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e7680f38-27bc-4cd2-8957-86d8faf48980-image.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 116px;\" /></p>",
