  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The required centripetal force will be provided by the normal reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>This equation is similar to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;which is a parabola.</p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
